#: ../../source/blog/auto_cuda_graph_design.md:12
msgid ""
"AutoCudaGraph is a CUDA Graph optimization module integrated into the "
"MagiCompiler framework, designed to automate CUDA Graph capture, caching,"
" replay, and tensor memory management for PyTorch-based neural network "
"inference. It targets Transformer architectures with dynamic sequence "
"lengths, optimizing kernel execution by reusing pre-captured computation "
"graphs and static tensor buffers. Core Goals:"
msgstr ""

